- Package does not add an entry to the Command Palette for editing its main settings. Create a 'Default.sublime-commands' file in the package with this content:
  ```json
  [
    {
      "caption": "Preferences: InlineGitBlame Settings",
      "command": "edit_settings",
      "args": {
        "base_file": "${packages}/InlineGitBlame/InlineGitBlame.sublime-settings"
      }
    }
  ]
  ```
- 'Main.sublime-menu' adds menu entries under 'Package Settings > Inline Git Blame'. We expect this to match the actual package name, e.g. 'Package Settings > InlineGitBlame'.
    File: Main.sublime-menu
